        "thinking": "I'm working through the lan madhyama bahuvacana form of चक्ष् in Atmanepada, applying the skoḥ saṃyogādyoranteca rule (8.2.29) to elide the स्/क् before the ध्वम् ending.\n\nAfter elision, ष् + ध् undergoes jaśtva to ड्, then ṣṭutva converts it further to ढ्, yielding अचड्ढ्वम् as the correct form. This matches the full known lan paradigm: अचष्ट, अचक्षाताम्, अचक्षत, अचष्ठाः, अचक्षाथाम्, अचड्ढ्वम्.\n\n",
